# Store originals as Base64 in Git so GitHub holds reversible text, not raw binaries.
# The "wedding-base64" clean/smudge filter named below is defined only in .git/config,
# which Git cannot read from tracked files. Install it once per clone with `npm install`
# or `npm run photos:setup`; that also restores local image/video files and adds a
# pre-commit guard. Without it Git silently commits the raw binary instead of Base64.
couple-images/** filter=wedding-base64 -diff -text
